WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.920
[Audience Clapping]

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:02.150
Ella is going into the Rock and Roll Hall

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.983
of Fame next month,

00:00:02.983 --> 00:00:04.171
and you've performed there,

00:00:04.171 --> 00:00:05.004
- [Guest Speaker] Yeah. (woman laughing)

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:05.837
