00:00:05.837 --> 00:00:07.150
What is your experience with that?

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:07.983
It's so amazing.

00:00:07.983 --> 00:00:08.816
- Oh my gosh. The Rock and Roll Hall-

00:00:08.816 --> 00:00:09.920
I remember when the Rock
and Roll Hall of Fame,

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.180
wasn't really a place.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:12.210
And then-

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:13.043
- What?

00:00:13.043 --> 00:00:14.838
- Because there was no hall of fame yet,

00:00:14.838 --> 00:00:15.950
it was just,

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:16.900
you were being inducted

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:17.857
and they were trying to build it.

00:00:17.857 --> 00:00:18.690
- Oh

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:22.093
- And so I inducted Janis
Joplin and Bonnie Raitt.

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:24.231
But then in 90 (indistinct)

00:00:24.231 --> 00:00:25.064
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:25.064 --> 00:00:25.897
- I know.

00:00:25.897 --> 00:00:26.730
- Just, that sentence alone.

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:27.563
(both laughing)

00:00:27.563 --> 00:00:28.897
- but then like in 95, 94,

00:00:28.897 --> 00:00:31.810
they had a big concert to open the hall.

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:32.643
- Yeah

00:00:32.643 --> 00:00:33.476
- That was amazing.

00:00:33.476 --> 00:00:35.100
Kelly, you would have freaked out because-

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:35.933
- Like who all were there?

00:00:35.933 --> 00:00:37.067
- Everybody was there.

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:40.920
I remember standing in the side, you know,

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:43.310
they had a little stand
for people backstage.

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:44.143
- Yeah

00:00:44.143 --> 00:00:44.976
- First of all,

00:00:44.976 --> 00:00:47.098
I remember dancing with
Chrissy Hind and Sheryl Crow

00:00:47.098 --> 00:00:47.931
- What?

00:00:47.931 --> 00:00:48.764
- and Natalie merchant.

00:00:48.764 --> 00:00:50.410
We were all dancing to like Al green

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:51.243
or something.

00:00:51.243 --> 00:00:52.205
- What kind of dream
sequence is this, yeah?

00:00:52.205 --> 00:00:53.038
- I know. No, it's crazy.

00:00:53.038 --> 00:00:56.420
And then we were on the stands
with Bruce Springsteen and

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:58.192
John Fogerty and John Mellencamp and,

00:00:58.192 --> 00:00:59.025
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:01.123
and we were all watching James Brown.

00:01:02.277 --> 00:01:03.110
- What?

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:03.960
- So it was unbelievable.
It was unbelievable.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:05.920
I even did a, a thing with,

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:08.144
with Bruce and Chuck Berry.

00:01:08.144 --> 00:01:09.990
It was unbelievable.

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:11.580
You'll never see because
Chuck messed it up.

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:12.797
He's he's really weird that way.

00:01:12.797 --> 00:01:13.630
(audience laughing)

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:14.540
- Wait, wait, I want to know how?

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:15.373
- No, because he (indistinct)

00:01:15.373 --> 00:01:16.830
he totally, we had, um...

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:18.237
A ducked down in the, um..

00:01:18.237 --> 00:01:20.180
the Stacks band playing

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.564
and they had been drinking a little bit.

00:01:21.564 --> 00:01:22.397
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:22.397 --> 00:01:23.770
and you know, cause it was a long day.

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:25.130
And they, we were playing.

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:26.489
And so Bruce said, Hey,
do you want to go play,

00:01:26.489 --> 00:01:28.890
you know, rock and roll music with Chuck?

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:29.730
I'm like, yeah.

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:31.590
And so Chuck tells me and Bruce

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:33.430
it's in the key of G,

00:01:33.430 --> 00:01:35.730
but he tells the band
it's in the key of B flat,

00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:37.110
and those two don't mix.

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:37.943
- Oh...

00:01:37.943 --> 00:01:40.290
- And so half the song, we're
all going, 'what's going on?'

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:42.800
It was really bad, but he
is notorious for doing that.

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:43.633
I don't know why.

00:01:43.633 --> 00:01:44.466
(Audience laughing)

00:01:44.466 --> 00:01:45.299
I don't know

00:01:45.299 --> 00:01:46.132
- I kind of really love it.

00:01:46.132 --> 00:01:47.394
- Yeah, it's all.. (mumble)

00:01:47.394 --> 00:01:48.661
- Not if I'm on stage

00:01:48.661 --> 00:01:49.494
- No, I was like 'oh...'

00:01:49.494 --> 00:01:51.492
- but if I'm off stage, I'm
like someone did something

00:01:51.492 --> 00:01:52.890
(guest speaker laughing)

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:53.723
That's amazing.

